New border system for blocks: a Border color and a new `border_widget` let editors choose which sides get a border (top, right, bottom, left) and its thickness, stored as `--cardBorderColor` and `--cardBorderWidth`. Each block decides where the border is drawn (image, text, card or container), and the color falls back to the block theme accent. It is available on all blocks except those in `config.settings.borderExcludedBlocks` (by default `separator`). @Humanaice
